    "Scan of the 1949 edition of the Cumberland, Maryland, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1949; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1981; printed in 1986.",
